There is a MAJOR difference between the ~1.3 speed you can get intrinsically,
and the 2.0 speed the boots give you.  While wearing boots, normal-speed
monsters CANNOT hit you.  Just hit them, step back, hit them, step back, etc.

Leocrottas, minotaurs and other monsters which can move and attack on the same
turn are an exception to this, but the boots can still give you a 2-to-1 ratio
of your hits to their hits.

